# Docs

- New or changed module/API/frontend surface → update `docs/modules/`, `docs/api/`, or `docs/frontend/` in the same change.
- Keep `docs/ROADMAP.md` checkboxes in sync with completed work.
- Prefer short, concrete docs over aspirational prose. Link to ports and fixture contracts when relevant.
